        <detaileddescription>
<para>Stops any ongoing CS test. When the local controller has sent all the remaining subevents for the ongoing procedure it will generate an <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__cs__test__end__completed" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_cs_test_end_completed</ref> event.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK if successful. Error code otherwise.</para>
</simplesect>
<bold>Events</bold> <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__cs__test__end__completed" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_cs_test_end_completed</ref> - Triggered when local controller has stopped the CS procedure started with the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__cs__test_1gaa66d7b45664c0c2e0b99db3946802ab2" kindref="member">sl_bt_cs_test_start</ref> command. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
